# XL project context

**Before** adding or changing **`//` comments**, **boxed function comment
blocks** (`// -----------` …), or **file header banners** in **`src/`** or
**`include/`**, read **`AGENTS.md`**: at least **Comment style** (and
**Workflow** if the change is non-trivial). Do not guess layout or ≤80 columns
from memory.

Before other substantive edits to this repo, read **`AGENTS.md`** for type
inference pitfalls (`Types::Evaluate`, `rcalls`, `evalInProgress`) and recorder
traces.

When the user gives important style or convention guidance—or corrects an
assistant mistake—**update `AGENTS.md`** in that turn (see “How to maintain”
there).

Boxed function comments: one “what” line inside the box; “why” and detail only
after the closing `// -----------`, each `//` line ≤ 80 characters (see
**`AGENTS.md`**, section **Comment style**).
